http://foo bar/
  default    http%3A%2F%2Ffoo%20bar%2F
  RFC 3986   http%3A%2F%2Ffoo%20bar%2F
  HTML 5     http%3A%2F%2Ffoo+bar%2F
  encodeURI  http://foo%20bar/
  RFC 3986 agrees with encode[s, 'url']: true
google.com/search?q=`Abdu'l-Bahá
