  HTML 5     google.com%2Fsearch%3Fq%3D%60Abdu%27l-Bah%C3%A1
  encodeURI  google.com/search?q=%60Abdu'l-Bah%C3%A1
  RFC 3986 agrees with encode[s, 'url']: true
mailto:crow@example.org?subject=¿Qué tal? 🐦
  default    mailto%3Acrow%40example%2Eorg%3Fsubject%3D%C2%BFQu%C3%A9%20tal%3F%20%F0%9F%90%A6
  RFC 3986   mailto%3Acrow%40example.org%3Fsubject%3D%C2%BFQu%C3%A9%20tal%3F%20%F0%9F%90%A6
  HTML 5     mailto%3Acrow%40example.org%3Fsubject%3D%C2%BFQu%C3%A9+tal%3F+%F0%9F%90%A6
  encodeURI  mailto:crow@example.org?subject=%C2%BFQu%C3%A9%20tal?%20%F0%9F%90%A6
